%%center BLAND and WELLER's
%%center Annual Collection of Twenty four
%%center COUNTRY DANCES for the YEAR 1798
%%center With their Figures
%%center for the Violin and German Flute.
%%center as they are performed at
%%center PERFORMED at COURT, BATH, and all PUBLIC ASSEMBLYS.
%%center -----------------------------------
%%center London, Printed & Sold at A Bland & Weller's Music Warehouse 23 Oxford Str.t
%%center -----------------------------------
%%text Transcription Notes:
%%begintext align
%% The files names have the form PPN_Dance_Name.abc,
%% where PP is the 2-digit page number (0-12) and N is the tune number on the page (1-2).
%% This gives the same order in the "all tunes" file as in the booklet.
%%endtext
%%center -----------------------------------

